{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12143","headline":"小园招隐 · 钱起","name":"小园招隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"支离鲜兄弟，形影如手足。\n但遂饮冰节，甘辞代耕禄。\n斑衣在林巷，始觉无羁束。\n交柯低户阴，闲鸟将雏宿。\n穷通世情阻，日夜苔径绿。\n谁言北郭贫，能分晏婴粟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}